WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:11.920
What are you doing in Paris?

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.180
I'll take it.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:14.880
This too.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.800
It's five hundred for the belt and two thousands for each bag.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:17.600
Great.

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:19.500
I'm a personal shopper.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.160
Here's a very high-profile.

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:22.100
Thank you.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:24.100
She can't do normal things.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.540
So, I assist her.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.380
You have nothing better to do besides dress Keira?

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:30.360
I'm waiting.

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:32.240
What are you waiting for?

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:38.800
My twin brother,died here

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:40.420
It's been 95 days.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.200
We made this oath.

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:47.200
Whoever died first will send the other a sign.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:48.760
From the afterlife.

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:54.980
Has that always been there?

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:58.500
Louis.

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:00.720
Are you here?

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:08.580
I had a sign.

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:09.560
Are you sure?

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:14.500
There was a presence.

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:15.700
Do you think Louis is here?

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:16.620
I don't know.

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:21.280
Keira?

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:23.180
I'm just gonna drop these bags for you, okay?

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:23.700
Hey.

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:32.680
Keira was murdered.

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:34.160
What were you doing at her place?

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:35.700
Why are you asking?

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:38.200
I'm lost.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:40.200
I can't tell whether or not i'm going crazy.

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:48.020
Louis is that you?

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:50.420
Or is it just me?

